{"synopsis":"Raja Gray memiliki kekuatan kekayaan dan prestise yang tak tertandingi di dunia yang diatur oleh kemampuan bela diri\nNamun kesendirian tetap ada di belakang mereka yang memiliki kekuatan besar\nDi bawah eksterior glamor seorang raja yang kuat mengintai cangkang manusia tanpa tujuan dan kemauan\nBereinkarnasi ke dunia baru yang penuh dengan sihir dan monster raja memiliki kesempatan kedua untuk menghidupkan kembali hidupnya\nNamun memperbaiki kesalahan masa lalunya tidak akan menjadi satusatunya tantangannya\nDi bawah kedamaian dan kemakmuran dunia baru adalah arus bawah yang mengancam untuk menghancurkan semua yang telah dia kerjakan\nmempertanyakan peran dan alasannya untuk dilahirkan kembali","alternative_title":"TBATE, 끝이 아닌 시작","author":"TurtleMe","artist":"Fuyuki23","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f955a39c-248a-47a5-8010-c6ef49f95520","number":"246","chapter":"246","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"088ba512-5f1d-4407-b5ff-d19eba8121a8","number":"245","chapter":"245","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24"},{"chapter_id":"9c5c8c9b-4e73-4f26-8262-53f4c937974a","number":"244","chapter":"244","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"ab3d1926-2875-48b5-bcaa-7e60ad16ec7f","number":"243","chapter":"243","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"05c07c35-6bfe-4efa-9607-e6df873a58fe","number":"242","chapter":"242","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"57115240-8043-4dbb-b6e2-7ab1ac210fcb","number":"241","chapter":"241","title":"","date":"2026-06-25","released":"2026-06-25"},{"chapter_id":"a395ad82-f7fb-4152-8ccb-8092a7461a2c","number":"240","chapter":"240","title":"","date":"2026-06-18","released":"2026-06-18"},{"chapter_id":"3dc92353-84e4-4d49-979c-c18b76809072","number":"239","chapter":"239","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"60a8f392-f3ba-48dc-ada3-ad3af91b22b5","number":"238","cha